r categoria econ\u00f4mica. Anexo I E Balan\u00e7o Or\u00e7ament\u00e1rio \u2013 Despesas por fun\u00e7\u00e3o. Anexo I F Execu\u00e7\u00e3o dos Restos a Pagar \u2013 Despesas por categoria econ\u00f4mica. Anexo I G Balan\u00e7o Or\u00e7ament\u00e1rio \u2013 Execu\u00e7\u00e3o dos Restos a Pagar \u2013 Despesas por fun\u00e7\u00e3o. Anexo I HI Demonstrativo das Varia\u00e7\u00f5es Patrimoniais.", "owner_org": "2cfc7764-5788-4322-8bba-1defafca0346", "extras": [{"key": "Categoria do e-VoG", "value": " Economia e Finan\u00e7as"}, {"key": "Data de in\u00edcio dos dados", "value": ""}, {"key": "Frequ\u00eancia de Atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o", "value": "Anual"}, {"key": "resource_group", "value": ""}], "license_url": "http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/odc-odbl", "title": "Demonstrativos das Contas Anuais dos Entes da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o", "revision_id": "2feadf1e-d988-4769-85a9-76d108132e5f"}, {"license_title": "Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)", "maintainer": "", "relationships_as_object": [], "private": false, "maintainer_email": "", "num_tags": 8, "id": "647eb588-a8a0-4ec5-9d14-6d185bfb8808", "metadata_created": "2019-10-02T15:31:54.647037", "metadata_modified": "2025-05-28T19:10:13.287095", "author": "CCONF", "author_email": "", "state": "active", "version": "", "creator_user_id": "135d1553-40ef-4a97-a337-84a81c86d709", "type": "dataset", "resources": [{"resource_group": "", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "647eb588-a8a0-4ec5-9d14-6d185bfb8808", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "28a7c016-5366-4bc0-82f4-655008b8910d", "size": "0", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "Informa\u00e7\u00f5es referentes \u00e0s contas cont\u00e1beis pertencentes \u00e0s classes de controle da Matriz de Saldos Cont\u00e1beis - MSC entregues pela Uni\u00e3o, Estados, DF e Munic\u00edpios.", "format": "API", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": null, "mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "API Dados Abertos - MSC Controle", "created": "2019-10-02T12:3